---
import DocLayout from '../layouts/DocLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<DocLayout title="Viewport">
  <h1>Viewport</h1>
  <p>
    Scene Light Manager (SLM) features high-performance viewport tools that allow you to adjust lights, rotate HDRI skies, and isolate illumination sources directly in the 3D viewport under your mouse cursor, avoiding N-Panel slider hunting.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Interactive HDRI & Sky Rotation</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">
    Instead of editing shader mapping nodes or diving into World tabs to rotate environment maps, SLM provides real-time Z-axis rotation shortcuts directly in the viewport.
  </p>

  <!-- HDRI Rotation and Strength Viewport Overlays -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <img 
          src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/world_rotation.png`} 
          alt="World Rotation Viewport Overlay" 
          class="h-auto max-h-[150px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Interactive World Z-Rotation rotation overlay</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <img 
          src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/world_strength.png`} 
          alt="World Strength Viewport Overlay" 
          class="h-auto max-h-[150px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Interactive World Strength multiplier overlay</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-white mt-0 mb-4 text-sm font-mono tracking-wider">Keyboard & Mouse Controls</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="bg-technical-amber/20 text-technical-amber border border-technical-amber/30 px-2 py-1 rounded font-mono text-[10px] shrink-0">Ctrl + Alt + RMB (Drag)</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-white block">Trigger Rotation</strong>
          Hold the keys and drag the mouse horizontally in the viewport to rotate the active sky coordinate system.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="bg-white/10 text-white border border-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded font-mono text-[10px] shrink-0">Left Click or Enter</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-white block">Confirm Action</strong>
          Saves the current rotation angle.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 border border-red-500/30 px-2 py-1 rounded font-mono text-[10px] shrink-0">Escape or Right Click</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-white block">Cancel & Reset</strong>
          Discards changes and resets coordinates to their initial values.
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive HDRI Rotation Modal Sub-controls -->
  <div class="p-5 bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/10 transition-colors mb-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <span class="text-white font-medium block text-xs">Interactive HDRI Rotation Modal Sub-controls</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-mono mt-1 block">Context: Active during k_tools.rotate_hdri modal loop</span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4 text-[11px]">
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1">TAB</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Cycles adjustment property sub-mode:
          <code class="text-[9px] text-zinc-400 font-mono block mt-1">ROTATION &rarr; STRENGTH &rarr; SUN_INTENSITY &rarr; SUN_ELEVATION</code>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1">R</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Resets the current active property back to its default value (0.0 for rotation, 1.0 for strength).
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1">Shift / Ctrl (Drag Mouse)</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Hold <kbd class="font-mono text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-800 rounded">Shift</kbd> for precision mode (0.1x sensitivity) or <kbd class="font-mono text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-800 rounded">Ctrl</kbd> for stepped snapping (5x).
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1">L-Click / Enter / R-Click / Esc</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Confirm adjustments with <kbd class="font-mono text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-800 rounded">L-Click</kbd>/<kbd class="font-mono text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-800 rounded">Enter</kbd>, or cancel and revert with <kbd class="font-mono text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-800 rounded">R-Click</kbd>/<kbd class="font-mono text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-800 rounded">Esc</kbd>.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Smart Context Detection</h3>
  <p>
    The rotation operator dynamically evaluates the active scene setup:
  </p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Nishita Sky Active</strong>
      Rotates the native Sun Angle coordinate.
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Custom HDRI mapping</strong>
      Drives rotation of Z-axis inputs in the Mapping Node.
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Material Preview Mode</strong>
      Drives native viewport studio HDRI rotation values.
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>2. Viewport Gizmo Buttons</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">
    Selecting any light source in the scene reveals a row of floating, transparent viewport button overlays next to the object pivot.
  </p>

  <!-- Viewport Gizmos Image -->
  <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl mb-6 group hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-3 flex justify-center">
      <img 
        src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/viewport_2d_gizmos.png`} 
        alt="Viewport Gizmo Buttons" 
        class="h-auto max-h-[250px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.01] zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] block font-mono text-center">Interactive floating viewport gizmos for quick type, shape, and size adjustments</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs mb-6">
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Type Selector (Lightbulb)</strong>
      Cycles the light source type (Area, Point, Spot, Sun).
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Shape Cycles (Square/Circle)</strong>
      Toggles Area light geometries (Square, Disk, Rectangle, Ellipse).
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Size Controller (Arrows)</strong>
      Click and drag to scale physical dimensions or radius.
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Beam/Spread (Concentric Circles)</strong>
      Click and drag to scale Area spread angles or Spot blending limits.
    </div>
  </div>

  <blockquote>
    <p>
      <strong>[NOTE] Customizing Gizmos:</strong> You can toggle individual button visibility, change sizes, spaces, offsets, and transparency settings under the Addon Preferences.
    </p>
  </blockquote>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>3. Quick Popup Menu (Y Key)</h2>
  <p class="mb-6">
    Pressing <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10 text-white font-mono text-xs border border-white/10">Y</kbd> in the 3D viewport spawns a complete parameters editor card directly at your mouse coordinates:
  </p>

  <!-- Quick Y Popup Menu Tabs Gallery -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img 
          src={`${base}panel_images/quick_action_panel-y_panel.png`} 
          alt="Y Menu - Settings Tab" 
          class="h-full w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-white text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Settings Tab</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img 
          src={`${base}panel_images/quick_action_panel-y_panel-nodes.png`} 
          alt="Y Menu - Nodes Tab" 
          class="h-full w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-white text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Nodes Tab</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img 
          src={`${base}panel_images/quick_action_panel-y_panel-world.png`} 
          alt="Y Menu - World Tab" 
          class="h-full w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-white text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">World Tab</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="space-y-4 mb-6">
    <li>
      <strong class="text-white block">SETTINGS Tab</strong>
      Offers quick adjustments for color temperatures, exposures, intensities, rig controls, constraints, and visibility toggles.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>NODES Tab</strong>
      Enables nodes, binds Gobo structures, loads projection maps, and displays shader preview rendering thumbnails.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>WORLD Tab</strong>
      Swaps background HDRI maps, manages Nishita Sky presets, and drives Z-rotations.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>4. Smart Light Isolation (Solo Mode)</h2>
  <p>
    Mutes all other lights in the scene instantly to isolate and tweak the active light source's shadows and color bounces.
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li>
      <strong>Activation:</strong> Click the Star/Solo button on the sidebar list or click the Star icon in the Viewport Gizmo.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>State Preservation:</strong> All original visibility statuses are cached. Toggling solo mode off returns the scene to its exact prior visibility layout.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Mute HDRI:</strong> Configurable preference to automatically black out world backgrounds while soloing lights to analyze light leaks.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>5. Interactive Light Placement (Pointer)</h2>
  <p class="mb-6">
    Project lights precisely onto your geometry. Selecting a light and running pointer placement will cause the light source to snap and align along the normals of surfaces under your cursor, pointing directly at the target highlight area. Useful for creating cinematic hair highlights, precise rim accents, and character eye specular spots.
  </p>

  <!-- Light Alignment Modal Overlay Showcase Image -->
  <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl mb-6 group hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-3 flex justify-center">
      <img 
        src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/light_alignment-modal-overlay_showcase.png`} 
        alt="Interactive Light Placement Pointer Overlay" 
        class="h-auto max-h-[350px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.01] zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] block font-mono text-center">Viewport overlay during pointer placement and light targeting mode</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Light Placement Modal Sub-controls -->
  <div class="p-5 bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/10 transition-colors mb-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <span class="text-white font-medium block text-xs">Interactive Light Placement Modal Sub-controls</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-mono mt-1 block">Context: Active during k_tools.light_at_point modal loop</span>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3 mt-4 text-[11px]">
      <!-- Viewport modes -->
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1">TAB</span>
          <span class="text-zinc-300 font-light font-sans">Cycles targeting modes: Reflective, Orbiting focus, or Direct Normal alignment.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-1.5 font-mono text-[9px] text-zinc-400 shrink-0">
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5">REFLECT</span>
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5">ORBIT</span>
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5">DIRECT</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mouse Scroll Wheel Combos -->
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-white font-medium block mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">Mouse Scroll Combinations</span>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-[11px] font-light">
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
            <span class="text-zinc-400 font-sans">Adjust Power / Energy</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5 rounded">Scroll Wheel</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
            <span class="text-zinc-400 font-sans">Adjust Emitter Size</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5 rounded">Shift + Scroll</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between md:border-none pb-1 md:pb-0">
            <span class="text-zinc-400 font-sans">Adjust Distance from Target</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5 rounded">Alt + Scroll</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-zinc-400 font-sans">Adjust Spread / Blend</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5 rounded">Ctrl + Scroll</kbd>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Light Types and Shapes -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-zinc-400 font-mono block mb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Switch Light Type</span>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 font-mono text-[9px]">
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Point</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">1</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Sun</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">2</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Spot</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">3</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Area</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">4</kbd></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-zinc-400 font-mono block mb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Switch Area Shape</span>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 font-mono text-[9px]">
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Square</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">S</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Rectangle</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">R</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Disk</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">D</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-zinc-500">Ellipse</span> <kbd class="px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">E</kbd></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Toggles -->
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-zinc-400 font-mono block mb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Auxiliary Actions</span>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-1.5 font-sans">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Toggle Emitter Visibility</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">H</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Toggle Solo / Isolate Mode</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">Shift + H</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1 md:border-none md:pb-0"><span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Link Receiver (Light Linking)</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">L</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1 md:border-none md:pb-0"><span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Link Blocker (Shadow Linking)</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">Shift + L</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center col-span-1 md:col-span-2 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-white/5"><span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Pause Cursor Projection Updates</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[9px] px-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded">P</kbd></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>6. Quick Light & Collection Navigation (Next / Prev)</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">
    To streamline your viewport workflow, SLM includes dedicated navigation controls that let you sequentially cycle active selection states without clicking on individual list rows or outliner folders.
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <!-- UI Buttons -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl hover:border-amber-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white text-xs font-semibold mb-2 font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
          </svg>
          Viewport UI Buttons
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">
          Located at the top header of the Light Manager list panel, you'll find navigation chevrons (<span class="text-white font-mono font-medium">◀</span> and <span class="text-white font-mono font-medium">▶</span>). Clicking these allows you to instantly step through active emitters sequentially with standard mouse clicks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/30 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/5 text-[10px] text-zinc-500 font-mono">
        Context: Selection cycles through the active list hierarchy.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Keyboard Hotkeys -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl hover:border-amber-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white text-xs font-semibold mb-2 font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          Keyboard Hotkeys
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">
          For speed-focused viewport workflow, use the native key bindings. You can cycle active selection states without looking away from your render:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-[11px]">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
            <span class="text-zinc-400">Next Light</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">.</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
            <span class="text-zinc-400">Previous Light</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">,</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
            <span class="text-zinc-400">Next Collection folder</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Shift + .</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-zinc-400">Previous Collection folder</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Shift + ,</kbd>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocLayout>
